  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COOPRORIZ Rusuli seeks to expand their capacity through multiple trainings, and to strengthen their activities and improve members&apos; incomes. They plan to increase production and processing by acquiring post-harvesting equipment and by renovating old drying yards and installing new ones.</narrative>
